    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Airbnb","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/airbnb"},"datePublished":"2026-06-30T20:14:33.569Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_coast-more-pay-less-activity-7477816872789241856-1ho0","text":"Some of the best beach towns in America aren't on any top 10 list.\n\nWe went looking for the ones where families still get the most for their money: the under-the-radar stretches of coast where a summer trip hasn't been priced out of reach.\n\nFull list here → https://lnkd.in/g4zbFhRS\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_coast-more-pay-less-activity-7477816872789241856-1ho0"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Airbnb","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/airbnb"},"datePublished":"2026-06-25T21:45:01.937Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_biggestgameonearth-activity-7476027701829603328-_T_Y","text":"Data shows that 68% of Latino adults in the US are interested in the FIFA World Cup 2026™, and 41% are taking a trip related to the tournament that they wouldn't have planned otherwise.*\n\n-  56% are traveling with extended family, and 64% say staying together is essential\n-  61% prefer short-term rentals over hotels, with kitchen amenities and gathering spaces making group travel more comfortable and practical\n-  67% rate visiting local restaurants and shops as highly important, driving economic impact in host city communities\n-  Miami, Los Angeles, and New York/New Jersey are top destinations, where travel and cultural connection go hand in hand\n\nBig events bring people together. But for US Latino families, togetherness is the event. More here → https://lnkd.in/emUVq9_w\n\n* Study conducted by Blue Point Analytix for Airbnb\n\n#BiggestGameOnEarth","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_biggestgameonearth-activity-7476027701829603328-_T_Y"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Airbnb","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/airbnb"},"datePublished":"2026-06-24T19:00:02.435Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_fifa-world-cup-2026-demand-data-activity-7475623792451493888-MFBo","text":"The best FIFA World Cup 2026™ stories aren't coming from inside the stadium. They're happening on the ground.\n\nOur tournament-time demand data reveals how fans are meeting this moment:\n\n⚽ The most-searched matches aren't tournament frontrunners. They're the underdog teams writing their stories in real time.\n\n🏙️ 15% of Gen Z are traveling in groups, swapping London, Glasgow, and Tokyo for US hotspots like Los Angeles, Miami, and New York.\n\n🏟️ The World Cup is driving longer stays, with Latin American and European visitors averaging 14–16 nights per trip.\n\n#BiggestGameOnEarth #FIFAWorldCup","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_fifa-world-cup-2026-demand-data-activity-7475623792451493888-MFBo"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Airbnb","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/airbnb"},"datePublished":"2026-06-22T23:06:26.947Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_as-millions-of-fans-plan-last-minute-travel-activity-7474961027399503873-YuTE","text":"As millions of fans plan last-minute travel for FIFA World Cup 2026™ knockout matches, we’ve scaled up safety and support across the board.\n\nOnline travel scams are rising, and with 62% of Americans saying AI-generated content makes fraud more convincing, the stakes are higher than ever. Here's how we're protecting our community:\n\n☑️ Anti-fraud technology that assesses new listings for risk signals and verifies guest and host identities\n☑️ In-app reminders to communicate, book, and pay on Airbnb, which reduce clicks on risky links by more than 20%\n☑️ Partnership with the International Association of Financial Crimes Investigators to educate travelers about online scams\n☑️ AirCover on every booking, including up to $3M in host damage protection\n☑️ Disruptive party ban in effect, backed by reservation screening technology across North America\n☑️ Proactive outreach to hundreds of local law enforcement agencies across all three host countries\n☑️ Expanded partnerships with It's a Penalty and ECPAT International to help combat human trafficking\n☑️ 13,000+ support agents available to assist 24/7 by phone, in-app, and via Help Center\n\nLearn more → https://lnkd.in/gJq8huuW","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_as-millions-of-fans-plan-last-minute-travel-activity-7474961027399503873-YuTE"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Airbnb","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/airbnb"},"datePublished":"2026-06-12T21:42:01.631Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_host-city-impact-program-activity-7471315903167721473-fEon","text":"The FIFA World Cup 2026™ will generate over $1 billion in local economic impact from Airbnb guests, according to Deloitte. \n\nBut that number doesn’t tell the whole story.\n\nOur $5 million Host City Impact Program is making sure the people who live in these cities share in that growth. Here's what that looks like on the ground:\n\n- 11 new and refurbished soccer mini-pitches across New York, New Jersey, and California\n- More than $1 million invested in Houston for green infrastructure and youth soccer access\n- Over 3,000 free match tickets donated to youth in underserved communities\n- More than $550,000 CAD in soccer infrastructure across 4 Ontario communities\n- Free post-match transit for fans after every Philadelphia match via SEPTA's Broad Street Line\n- Investments in Kansas City’s Open Doors! small business program and Rhode Island’s Summer of Soccer\n- A community-driven exhibition of art and memorabilia celebrating Mexico City’s rich football heritage\n- Fan Zone grants to create gathering spaces in 9 communities across Washington state\n\nMore coming as the tournament progresses. \n\n#BiggestGameOnEarth #FIFAWorldCup","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_host-city-impact-program-activity-7471315903167721473-fEon"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Airbnb","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/airbnb"},"datePublished":"2026-06-12T00:05:57.937Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_the-fifa-world-cup-2026-is-set-to-be-the-activity-7470989738779508736-GDPY","text":"The FIFA World Cup 2026™ is set to be the most watched event on earth.\n\nBut the real magic? It happens off the pitch. In the homes of hosts who make strangers feel welcome. Over shared meals, shared games, shared cities.\n\nThat's what Airbnb was built for. The world is meant to meet.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/airbnb_the-fifa-world-cup-2026-is-set-to-be-the-activity-7470989738779508736-GDPY"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Airbnb","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/airbnb","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"888 Brannan Street","addressLocality":"San Francisco","addressRegion":"CA","postalCode":"94103","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays, experiences and services that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":71563,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQFhfl32crIGIw/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1630637496980/airbnb_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=DM3Ato8740GzY9eDPP_-yOTo68rXQlVD9YK4n3hR3Is","description":"Airbnb","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"Airbnb is a community based on connection and belonging.","sameAs":"http://airbnb.com"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
