        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Following the catastrophic earthquakes in Venezuela last week, we’re working with several nonprofit partners to provide free housing for the critical workers helping communities recover.

For first responders, having a place to rest gives them a chance to recharge and be ready for the next day’s work.

Our hearts continue to be with the people of Venezuela.

Learn more about our response here:
<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/g9NHgi6v?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/g9NHgi6v</a> </p>
          
            
                  
    

