        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary"><a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/boatsetter?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Boatsetter</a> just launched on <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/airbnb?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Airbnb</a> Services.

Four convenient marinas, a curated selection of 5-star boat days, all with certified Captains at the helm.

Airbnb Guests from around the world will travel to Miami this summer, and locals know if you want to experience the best of Miami, being on the water is one of the best ways to do it. Cruise the Bay, snorkel the Fowey Rocks Lighthouse, anchor near Key Biscayne – all easily within reach when you book a boat for a half or full day. 

Read more: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gjyHN44Q?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gjyHN44Q</a></p>
