  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">As millions of fans plan last-minute travel for FIFA World Cup 2026™ knockout matches, we’ve scaled up safety and support across the board.

Online travel scams are rising, and with 62% of Americans saying AI-generated content makes fraud more convincing, the stakes are higher than ever. Here's how we're protecting our community:

☑️ Anti-fraud technology that assesses new listings for risk signals and verifies guest and host identities
☑️ In-app reminders to communicate, book, and pay on Airbnb, which reduce clicks on risky links by more than 20%
☑️ Partnership with the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/international-association-of-financial-crimes-investigators?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>International Association of Financial Crimes Investigators</a> to educate travelers about online scams
☑️ AirCover on every booking, including up to $3M in host damage protection
☑️ Disruptive party ban in effect, backed by reservation screening technology across North America
☑️ Proactive outreach to hundreds of local law enforcement agencies across all three host countries
☑️ Expanded partnerships with <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/itsapenalty?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>It's a Penalty</a> and <a class="link" href="https://th.linkedin.com/company/ecpat-international?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>ECPAT International</a> to help combat human trafficking
☑️ 13,000+ support agents available to assist 24/7 by phone, in-app, and via Help Center

Learn more → <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gJq8huuW?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gJq8huuW</a></p>
<!---->  </div>



        

        
            
      
    
    
    

